WEBVTT

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:30.890
It has emotions,

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:34.426
anger and happiness.

00:00:34.426 --> 00:00:38.220
It has memories, like scenes from your childhood

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.920
playing before you.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:45.375
And it has this constant voiceover narrative

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:49.751
in your stream of conscious thinking.

00:00:49.751 --> 00:00:54.824
At the heart of this movie is you

00:00:54.824 --> 00:00:59.189
experiencing all this directly.

00:00:59.189 --> 00:01:04.881
This movie is your stream of consciousness,